<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">brawling</ansi> (skill)

The <ansi fg="skill">brawling</ansi> skill gives you physical combat
techniques beyond basic attacks. As your skill grows,
you unlock more powerful moves.

<ansi fg="yellow">Abilities: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="skill">recover</ansi>
    Enter a state of focused rest, recovering Health
    more quickly than normal.

  <ansi fg="skill">throw [object] [target/direction]</ansi>
    Hurl an object at a creature or into an adjacent
    room.

  <ansi fg="skill">tackle [target]</ansi>
    Rush an opponent and attempt to knock them down,
    causing them to lose their next action. Your speed
    and their awareness determine the outcome.

  <ansi fg="skill">disarm [target]</ansi>
    Attempt to wrench a weapon from an opponent's grasp.
    Pits your agility and cunning against their grip
    and awareness.

